Modalities: Full-field digital mammography (4-view) + BI-RADS + lesion-level annotations Patients: 5,000 exams (20,000 images) Origin: Vietnam (Hospital 108 + Hanoi Medical University Hospital) Format: DICOM Access: VinDr-Mammo is publicly available on PhysioNet as a new imaging resource to promote advances in CADe/x tools for mammography interpretation. 
