📌 Gap Addressed
Existing multi-modal fusion strategies are categorized into feature-level, decision-level, and hybrid fusion — yet most existing studies perform only binary classification 
Nature
, missing the clinically vital outputs of BI-RADS grading and lesion segmentation simultaneously. No paper performs all three jointly from fused US+mammogram. BCMID uniquely provides BI-RADS labels per patient, making it the only dataset enabling this exact problem.

