Design a hierarchical cross-modal Vision Transformer that simultaneously performs (1) BI-RADS category grading, (2) lesion segmentation in both US and mammogram spaces, and (3) binary malignancy classification, using a shared cross-modal attention backbone trained on paired ultrasound and mammogram images.

