Only 12 of 49 reviewed studies used explainability methods alongside multimodal fusion, and these strategies remain relatively uncommon despite being critical for clinical adoption. 
PubMed Central
 Recognizing the pivotal role of AI systems that seamlessly integrate different medical modalities, researchers have acknowledged that clinical decision support requires interpretable systems that align with radiologists' reasoning workflows. 
