Build a Concept Bottleneck Model (CBM) whose intermediate neurons correspond 1-to-1 with the official ACR BI-RADS descriptor vocabulary (shape, margin, orientation, posterior features, calcification morphology, vascularity), enabling the model to explain its malignancy prediction in clinical language while fusing ultrasound and mammogram features.

