Vision backbone: Frozen SAM2 image encoder + modality-specific LoRA adapters (rank=16, <1% extra parameters)
Text backbone: Frozen CLIP text encoder + domain-adapted prompt tuning for BI-RADS vocabulary
Cross-modal alignment: Contrastive loss aligning US and Mammo lesion embeddings to the same text prototype space
Prompt engineering: Soft visual prompts (learnable tokens) that replace manual point/box prompts in SAM2
Decoder: SAM2 mask decoder (frozen) for segmentation; linear probe on CLIP space for classification
