SAM2 and CLIP are publicly available with pretrained weights; LoRA fine-tuning requires modest GPU (single A100); this directly targets the frontier of foundation model adaptation for medical imaging — publishable in MICCAI 2026, MedIA, or Nature Machine Intelligence.

🧠 Problem Statement 6
