Develop a modality-heterogeneous federated learning framework where client hospitals can participate with any subset of modalities (US only, Mammogram only, or both), collaboratively training a shared multimodal fusion model without sharing raw patient data — using modality-agnostic encoders and server-side cross-modal knowledge distillation.

