BI-RADS Acc, QWK	10%, 20%, 50% labeled	MLP on frozen ViT
Node embedding quality	Silhouette score by BI-RADS	Without graph
Label propagation accuracy	Unlabeled node accuracy	GCN, GAT, GraphSAGE
Graph structure	Cluster purity by BI-RADS	Ablation: US-only / Mammo-only edges
